{"title":"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>One proposal for new postage rates for a letter was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/4/d54b79083702aaba09c20024a5107a7824d3a4b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30\\cent$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"17\" /> for the first ounce and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/0/bf05bc95388eb5c5b8fc65ee3a69f39a07ca0f5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22\\cent$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"17\" /> for each additional ounce (or fraction of an ounce).  The postage for a letter weighing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/b/0fbe18900c777778ad24c84cb3d99df7032b4fd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> ounces was\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/8/2e828e5945ffef73f079394083823821ab1d0126.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 96\\cent \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\$1.07 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\$1.18 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\$1.20 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\$1.40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"479\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/7/df73f2f4451c372f82bcdcbfdc7dc096eeebb752.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4.5-1=3.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"104\" height=\"15\" /> additional ounces, which would round up to paying for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> additional ounces.  Therefore, the total cost is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/5/0a559e2589abcfe7c2c3c8c7f82444017f35a9e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$0.30 + 4 \\cdot \\$ 0.22 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\$1.18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"240\" height=\"31\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME\" title=\"1990 AJHSME\">1990 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1990\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1990 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1990_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" ti